Yetka
=====

Yetka is a GPL-3.0-or-later community distribution built from the JumpServer
community codebase. Copyright and license notices in source files and bundled
third-party dependencies remain authoritative and must be preserved.

External Yetka components are independently maintained repositories pinned in
`components.lock.yml`. Their individual notices and licenses are included in
their release archives. No xpack/EE or closed enterprise artefact is part of
the Yetka foundation release.
